      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The pressure you feel from everyone else is a heavy weight, but it's not the only thing that matters. Your identity is so much bigger than this one project, even if it feels like it right now. Instead of trying to fix the past, maybe you could just focus on the next small, manageable thing, even if it's just getting through the next hour. There are always new paths, even when the old ones seem completely blocked off.",
